# oracle: fix srd with big triangle particles held in fix rigid bodies (two bodies of two triangles each by molecule ID, fix rigid molecule, noslip, overlap yes, shift yes, cubic warn, search 0.2), 3d (a cut-down of examples/ASPHERE/tri/in.tri.srd: the first SRD run only, on a box of side 8 with the SRD lattice at density 20 (4344 atoms at density 10; 8117 here), 60 steps with thermo every step (the first triangle collisions are at step 31), the fix deform and the change_box triclinic phase left out; the small particles' forces are zeroed by fix setforce, since native leaves them uninitialised)
# oracle-inputs: w254srd_tri_rigid.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 5.7e-15, atoms 4.7e-14.
units		lj
atom_style	tri
atom_modify	first big
dimension	3

read_data	w254srd_tri_rigid.data

lattice		sc 0.4
region		box block INF INF INF INF INF INF
lattice		sc 20.0
create_atoms	2 region box

group		big type 1
group		small type 2
set		group small mass 0.01
set		group big angmom 0.2 -0.1 0.3

pair_style	lj/cut 1.5
pair_coeff	1 1 0.0 1.0
pair_coeff	2 2 0.0 1.0 0.0
pair_coeff	1 2 0.0 1.0

delete_atoms	overlap 1.5 small big

reset_timestep	0

velocity	small create 1.44 87287 loop geom
velocity	big set 0.1 -0.05 0.08

neighbor	0.3 multi
neigh_modify	delay 0 every 1 check yes
neigh_modify	exclude molecule/intra big include big

comm_modify	mode multi group big vel yes
neigh_modify	include big

pair_style	tri/lj 3.5
pair_coeff	1 1 0.1 1.0
pair_coeff	2 2 0.0 1.0 0.0
pair_coeff	1 2 0.0 1.0 0.0

timestep	0.002

fix		1 big rigid molecule
fix		2 small srd 20 big 1.0 1.0 49894 search 0.2 cubic warn 0.0001 shift yes 49829 overlap yes collision noslip
fix		3 small setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0

compute		tsmall small temp
compute		1 big erotate/asphere
compute		2 all ke
compute		3 all pe
variable	pebig equal pe*atoms/count(big)
variable	ebig equal etotal*atoms/count(big)

thermo_style	custom step c_tsmall f_2[1] f_2[2] f_2[3] f_2[4] f_2[5] f_2[6] f_2[7] f_2[8] f_2[9] f_2[10] f_2[11] f_2[12] c_1 etotal v_pebig v_ebig press
thermo_modify	temp tsmall
thermo_modify	format float %.15g
thermo		1

run		60
